{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026T7YlcAMKyg1795875657.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國網球巡迴賽香港公開賽，男單頭號種子孫淺晉級決賽。</p><p></p><p>藍衫、來自江蘇的孫淺，四強面對廣西隊的韓錫銳，首盤憑第11局破發，先贏7-5。打出氣勢，第二盤更打破對方所有發球局，上網進攻，令對方打出界。</p><p></p><p>這位全運男雙金牌得主，大勝6-0，直落兩盤晉級，決賽對胡佳。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T15:01:32.793274+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T14:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:53:26.923375+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:53:26.923375+00:00","content_hash":"99766c3612afa541c2bd6405ca1212c3358dcf8cd0576e7f495907d99bc7bfd1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}